  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Department of Energy, Analysis of Strategic Commodity Transfers (ASCOT) Workshop</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Analysis of Strategic Commodity Transfers (ASCOT) Workshop is an advanced license analysis course designed for licensing officers and technical staff involved in the license review process. The objective of ASCOT is to ensure that these personnel can effectively perform proliferation risk analyses and have a basic level of technical knowledge of controlled goods to apply toward such reviews.</narrative>
  </description>
